==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*gebaną}}, akin to Old English {{term|giefan|ġiefan|lang=ang}}, {{term|gefan|lang=ang}}, Old Frisian {{term|jeva|lang=ofs}}, Old Saxon and Old Dutch {{term|gevan|lang=osx}}, Old High German {{term|geban|lang=goh}}, Gothic {{term|𐌲𐌹𐌱𐌰𐌽|tr=giban|lang=got}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|non}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*gʰab(ʰ)-}}.

